+## [0.3.3] - 2021-03-05
+### Changed
+ - Performance improvements for small images.
+ - Add a (flag-protected) non-high-precision mode with better speed.
+ - Significantly speed up the PQ EOTF.
+ - Allow optional HDR tone mapping in djxl (--tone_map, --display_nits).
