--- chromium-116.0.5845.96/third_party/libjxl/src/doc/xl_overview.md.15~	2023-08-21 02:39:40.619511116 +0200
+++ chromium-116.0.5845.96/third_party/libjxl/src/doc/xl_overview.md	2023-08-21 02:39:40.619511116 +0200
