+## JPEG XL MIME type
+
+If not already installed by the [Installing section of README.md](../../README.md#installing), then it can be done manually:
+
+### Install
+```bash
+sudo xdg-mime install --novendor image-jxl.xml
+```
+
+Then run:
+```
+update-mime --local
+```
+
+
+### Uninstall
+```bash
+sudo xdg-mime uninstall image-jxl.xml
+```
+
